WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.290
The One Piece Manga just dropped a bombshell,
by revealing the true origin of Devil Fruits,

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:11.420
that no one expected. Oda might just have
broken the 4th wall and written himself into

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.269
the story. And because the literal phrasing
here is incredibly important, I want to give

00:00:15.269 --> 00:00:21.090
you the literal translation of what Dr. Vegapunk
tells the straw hats in the original Japanese

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.330
version: When he sees Gear 5 and realizes
that Luffy’s Devil Fruit takes the form

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.840
of Nika, he says this:

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.630
‘You probably have not heard the name Nika
before, because it’s a name that was erased

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:40.080
from history. However as long as people keep
wishing for him he can never be erased. Everything

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:46.460
is born into into this world after it was
wished for. The same goes for Devil Fruits.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:52.879
If things only were like this or if only that
happened…they are powers of a wide range

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:59.280
of wishes for humanity’s future. Therefore,
these artificial fruits are hated by the mother

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.690
of nature, which is the sea. That’s just
my personal hypothesis. I’m not even thinking

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:10.260
about whether there are gods or not. Isn’t
that fascinating! So, devil fruit users are

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:16.360
actually beings created from someone’s imagination
that lives in a different dimension.’

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:24.400
Yes Vegapunk, this is pretty fascinating.
Holy Usopp. This is by far the biggest lore

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:30.610
drop we’ve ever had about devil fruits in
the entire story. Something we’ve been waiting

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:36.040
for since the beginning of Luffy’s adventure.
There is so much we have to talk about here,

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:45.439
because this answers a ton of questions we
had, but raises even more new ones. ‘Devil

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:51.470
Fruits are actually beings created by someone’s
imagination living in another dimension’.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:57.250
Oda did you just write yourself into the story?
We need to discuss this. However, the first

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.970
thing, before we can get into the meats and
potatoes of this, that we need to address

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:08.300
, is the big caveat that Vegapunk gives us
here: All this information is his own personal

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:13.629
hypothesis. In other words, Vegapunk himself
has deduced this much from all his research

00:02:13.629 --> 00:02:18.520
and the research made by the archeologists
on Ohara, but he acknowledges himself that

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:24.810
it’s not confirmed the whole story. Knowing
Oda, I believe that there is a lot of truth

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:31.250
to what Vegapunk said here, but I’m convinced
there will be a few twists to this explanation

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.610
in the end.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:41.300
But with that said, let’s go through everything
we’ve gotten here, because it’s a lot.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:45.170
Basically Vegapunk’s hypothesis states,
that Devil Fruits are created from people’s

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:50.659
imagination and wishes for the future. And
as long as people keep wishing for these things,

00:02:50.659 --> 00:02:57.090
they will become reality in the world of One
Piece. His example here is Luffy’s Nika

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:02.950
Devil Fruit. Vegapunk actually didn’t seem
to know that this particular devil fruit existed.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:09.280
He looks up the Gomu Gomu no mi in the ancient
devil fruit encyclopedia, yes that’s a thing

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:14.180
too apparently that we’ll have to talk about
at some point. And he realizes that there

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:21.430
never was a Gomu Gomu no mi. However, apparently
Vegapunk has either seen an image of the sun

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:27.760
god nika or heard a description of his appearance,
because he correctly identifies that Luffy’s

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:34.581
gear 5 is Nika, based on some ancient texts
he references. Once again, I do wonder, whether

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:40.310
all these ancient things that Vegapunk references,
are all dating back to the Void Century and

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:47.470
Joy Boy’s time, or if this goes back even
further in time. After all the void century

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:54.120
is ‘only’ 800 years ago, while One Piece
history dates back at least several thousand

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.120
years.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:59.780
Then of course there is also the entire Luffy
vs Lucci thing and Lucci’s awakened devil

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:04.220
fruit having the same steam coat around his
body as Luffy and Yamato. In generall, this

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:09.640
chapter answers a bunch of questions we had
about devil fruit awakening and how it works.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:14.439
Especially in the context of this new information,
there is a lot we can deduce, especially about

00:04:14.439 --> 00:04:20.190
Zoan fruits. And i want to discuss this in
detail, so I will make a dedicated video about

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:25.800
that that will be out within a week, if at
least 1000 people subscribe until tomorrow.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:30.500
Anyways, Vegapunk basically says, that even
though Nika’s name and the true name of

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:35.100
Luffy’s devil fruit were erased from history
by the world government, the powers of sun

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:42.570
god Nika will never cease to be as long as
people believe in his existence. As we know,

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:49.229
Nika is a deity worshiped by slaves as the
warrior of liberation. In other words, Nika

00:04:49.229 --> 00:04:55.130
would be the literal embodiment of people’s
wish for freedom, which of course fits in

00:04:55.130 --> 00:05:00.400
perfectly with the main theme of One Piece
and what Luffy represents as a character:

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.400
Freedom.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:08.780
So it turns out that Blackbeard was being
quite literal, when he said that dreams never

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:16.330
die. He wasn’t being philosophical at all.
He KNOWS, that people’s dreams literally

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:22.460
never die, as they are reborn as devil fruits
as long as people believe in them. It looks

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:27.820
like this was a major piece of foreshadowing,
that Blackbeard had knowledge about devil

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:33.259
fruits, no one else has. This is speculation,
but it might well be the case, that this is

00:05:33.259 --> 00:05:38.350
the key to Blackbeard’s ability to steal
devil fruits as well. Maybe the darkness fruit

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:42.780
is the strongest devil fruit in his eyes,
because if there is darkness, there can be

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:49.380
no other dreams when you sleep. Maybe exactly
how this fruit can cancel out other fruit

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.030
powers, and why Blackbeard never sleeps.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:58.440
I have also at length talked about the fact,
that devil fruits might be related to inherited

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:04.120
will. Inherited will in one piece basically
describes handing down ones own dream to the

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:09.690
next person. And that the countless examples
of devil fruits apparently changing people’s

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:21.590
personality, might be due to the will of previous
owners stored inside them. Which also seems

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:29.080
to be connected to the so called lineage factor
discovered by Vegapunk, and is essential to

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:33.370
devil fruits.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:38.940
All of this of course gives extra special
meaning to Roger’s final words at his execution.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:43.760
**Inherited Will, The winding of the Ages,
and The Dreams of the People.**&nbsp;**As long

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.330
as people continue to pursue the meaning of
Freedom, these things will never cease to

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.430
be!**

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:56.930
This might be Roger describing the secret
of devil fruits in the very first chapter

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:03.729
of one piece. People’s dreams and passing
those dreams on to others, which literally

00:07:03.729 --> 00:07:09.720
keeps Devil Fruits in circulation. And the
winding of the ages might refer to the wide

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:16.139
variety of futures of humanity, that people
wish for, that Vegapunk talks about as well.

00:07:16.139 --> 00:07:23.169
Everything fits in perfectly with what Blackbeard
and Roger have said. Only that dreams have

00:07:23.169 --> 00:07:28.090
a much more literal power in the world, than
we thought.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.940
Now the reason i said that no one expected
this reveal at the beginning, of this video

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:37.360
is not because I believe that no one ever
had the idea that Devil Fruits could be based

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.550
on people’s dream. In fact you probably
thought to yourself: What do you mean unexpected,

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:48.180
I thought of that ages ago. In fact I myself
made a video over half a year ago talking

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:53.280
about the possibility that devil fruits might
be created from human imagination. But the

00:07:53.280 --> 00:08:01.210
reason i found this reveal so unexpected,
was because so far, Egghead island had basically

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:07.919
one big message for us. And that is: Everything
in one piece, that looks like magic, actually

00:08:07.919 --> 00:08:14.191
is ancient lost technology. Basically the
idea was that everything that’s strange

00:08:14.191 --> 00:08:19.759
in One Piece can be explained by a technologically
super advanced civilization that tapped into

00:08:19.759 --> 00:08:26.539
an unlimited energy source that allowed them
to do basically anything. We know that Vegapunk

00:08:26.539 --> 00:08:31.960
was able to create artificial devil fruits
using science and it fit in very nicely with

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:38.890
the idea that all of this is just super advanced
technology. And now suddenly, the main science

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:45.470
guy himself, tells us that actually if you
just wish for something hard enough, it will

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:52.521
come true in this world? It just feels very
paradoxical to me. Which one is it now? Are

00:08:52.521 --> 00:08:57.500
devil fruits and haki Magic? Or is it science?

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.940
Vegapunk himself actually addresses this himself
as well. Remember he said that he doesn’t

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:09.060
really care wether this is the work of gods
or a god. In other words, he doesn’t actually

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:15.721
know how wishes and dreams become reality.
Which sounds a bit fishy to me. Don’t you

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:22.660
think that the man who wants to know anything
about the world and ancient powers, would

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:29.830
want to find out how they work and where they
come from? I think either Vegapunk is salty

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:36.610
that he couldn’t find out or he is actively
withholding some information here. After all,

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:42.080
in order to create an artificial devil fruit
in a lab, he clearly must have at least some

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:47.839
scientific understanding of these fruits.
For example Momo’s devil fruit was created

00:09:47.839 --> 00:09:54.860
by using Kaido’s lineage factor, basically
the equivalent of DNA in one piece.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:10:00.579
Also, Vegapunk contradicts himself a little
in his speech when it comes to this. He talks

00:10:00.579 --> 00:10:07.100
about how the sea, which is the mother of
nature and how the sea hates these artificially

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:14.769
created things. The japanese here uses shizen
and fushizen, which means nature or natural

00:10:14.769 --> 00:10:20.630
and unnatural or artificial. In other words,
he openly describes these manifested powers

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:25.640
as artificial creations. So, which one is
it vegapunk? My best guess right now would

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:33.529
be that someone had either the advanced technology
or the supernatural power to create this mechanism

00:10:33.529 --> 00:10:36.839
in the one piece world.

00:10:36.839 --> 00:10:46.820
And the key to that is Vegapunk’s most interesting
statement of all here: ‘能力者とは誰かが思いえがいたいくつものいじげんを生きる者たち’

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:53.579
Which first of all is such a strangely phrased
sentence. I asked some of my japanese friends

00:10:53.579 --> 00:10:59.530
to help me translate it and everyone said
something different. But here is the gist:

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:05.170
Ability users are people who live in many
different dimensions that someone envisioned.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:14.190
Ijigen means different dimension without any
doubt, so this is a big deal one way or the

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:20.670
other. But It seems like Oda is keeping this
a bit vague on purpose. And puh, this could

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:27.350
mean so many things. Is it the actual fruit
users themselves who live in a different dimension?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:33.640
Because to me it seems like they very much
live right here in the one piece world. Is

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:37.940
it that those different dimensions are created
by someone and devil fruit users can access

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:45.010
them to use their powers? Or does it mean
that people from another dimension who envision

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:51.070
a certain ability, and that ability than materializes
in the one piece dimension? Which would basically

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:58.149
mean that Oda imagining these powers in our
dimension makes them a reality in One Piece.

00:11:58.149 --> 00:12:04.060
oda saying that for him one piece is a real
world and that vegapunk is aware of the fact

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:12.380
that our world exists? Which would be the
most meta Rick and Morty twist Oda could possibly

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:18.160
pull off. These reveals are getting crazier
and crazier and if you missed my thoughts

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:21.200
on last week’s chapter, make sure to check
that out right here.

